$ matrix, the determinant is given by the formula\n\n$$\n|\\begin{aligned}a & b \\\\ c & d\\end{aligned}|=ad-bc.\n$$\n\nUsing the formula, we have:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{det}(M) & =|\\begin{aligned}2 & w \\\\ 4 & 3\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =2\\cdot 3-w\\cdot 4 \\\\  & =6-4w.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n    \n\nSince $det(M)=2$, we get:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(M) & =2 \\\\ 6-4w & =2 \\\\ -4w & =2-6 \\\\ -4w & =-4 \\\\ w & =1\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-11653/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "4ccdde46-a4ab-517e-910b-571a3a166b6a"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-11653"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-275598/field-1/eadb4f132857861f1e64373661b9a01bc3625cc86bcffcc32659fc4899904fe0" :answer/id #uuid "f526d1f9-2ba6-5d44-9d75-186d092137c8" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "5" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-275598/field-1/4de395131b8c6206950603752bf3404c42f4dd6f0a41fee38e42388d1b92c133" :answer/id #uuid "06305b7b-b3b2-5d7a-8771-f52f72c3ce6f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-5" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-275598/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "fb7e30d8-94fb-59c4-8fdc-8aad00dc1f31" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "q-275598/field-1/eadb4f132857861f1e64373661b9a01bc3625cc86bcffcc32659fc4899904fe0" :answer-field/choices ["q-275598/field-1/eadb4f132857861f1e64373661b9a01bc3625cc86bcffcc32659fc4899904fe0" "q-275598/field-1/4de395131b8c6206950603752bf3404c42f4dd6f0a41fee38e42388d1b92c133"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-275598" :question/id #uuid "5c5e5d66-ec9d-5044-ad73-c77116b673b4" :question/math-academy-id "q-275598" :question/problem "If\n    $C=[\\begin{aligned}1 & k \\\\ 4 & 6\\end{aligned}]$\nand\n$\\text{det}(C)=-14,$ determine the value of $k.$\n\n$k=$\n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "For a $2\\times 2$ matrix, the determinant is given by the formula\n\n$$\n|\\begin{aligned}a & b \\\\ c & d\\end{aligned}|=ad-bc.\n$$\n\nUsing the formula, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{det}(C) & =|\\begin{aligned}1 & k \\\\ 4 & 6\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =1\\cdot 6-k\\cdot 4 \\\\  & =6-4k.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince $det(C)=-14$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(C) & =-14 \\\\ 6-4k & =-14 \\\\ -4k & =-14-6 \\\\ -4k & =-20 \\\\ k & =5.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-275598/field-1"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "4ccdde46-a4ab-517e-910b-571a3a166b6a"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-275598"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-127607/selection/62a6fd1cf465955cead36d661dcbed2f93206049c15d21d7eebcabb802d1aa54" :answer/id #uuid "d10076c8-a410-5a45-a81e-d6e6f74574f5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-127607/selection/35f5572ccca3a8c38d3ca06e2a92b51065f48e45d29833e19f4eb153cae096fc" :answer/id #uuid "b07abc1e-8401-52c3-b742-f5645ab11fde" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\frac{5}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-127607/selection/303632d9519e4b7e53f9af56aad03bb866b8b5ede58a0b8b2cb848d575460c53" :answer/id #uuid "27b123e9-c64b-5ec8-92be-fae77597bfdf" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "9" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-127607/selection/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b" :answer/id #uuid "ac6d5e2e-2fd7-51fc-991f-a5c12f612cf0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-127607/selection/b93157e0eb36ec8e645eeabaa0819400f448209e0db24c1abf59704822466393" :answer/id #uuid "ac39fb97-ff60-54e9-95e7-093e71cdac90" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\frac{3}{4}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-127607/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "db26e4b6-6fc0-57a8-90ed-a0f70166b6ff" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-127607/selection/62a6fd1cf465955cead36d661dcbed2f93206049c15d21d7eebcabb802d1aa54" :answer-field/choices ["q-127607/selection/62a6fd1cf465955cead36d661dcbed2f93206049c15d21d7eebcabb802d1aa54" "q-127607/selection/35f5572ccca3a8c38d3ca06e2a92b51065f48e45d29833e19f4eb153cae096fc" "q-127607/selection/303632d9519e4b7e53f9af56aad03bb866b8b5ede58a0b8b2cb848d575460c53" "q-127607/selection/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b" "q-127607/selection/b93157e0eb36ec8e645eeabaa0819400f448209e0db24c1abf59704822466393"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-127607" :question/id #uuid "39d1c2d9-3c21-5e66-9ca6-fdd489e649b3" :question/math-academy-id "q-127607" :question/problem "If\n$P=[\\begin{aligned}r-3 & r \\\\ 3 & r\\end{aligned}]$\nand $det(P)=-9$, what is the value of $r?$" :question/worked-solution "For a $2\\times 2$ matrix, the determinant is given by the formula\n\n$$\n|\\begin{aligned}a & b \\\\ c & d\\end{aligned}|=ad-bc.\n$$\n\nUsing the formula, we have:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(P) & =|\\begin{aligned}r-3 & r \\\\ 3 & r\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =(r-3)\\cdot r-r\\cdot 3 \\\\  & ={r}^{2}-6r\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince $det(P)=-9$, we obtain:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(P) & =-9 \\\\ {r}^{2}-6r & =-9 \\\\ {r}^{2}-6r+9 & =0 \\\\ (r-3)^{2} & =0 \\\\ r & =3\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-127607/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "4ccdde46-a4ab-517e-910b-571a3a166b6a"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-127607"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-127604/selection/b5a1b0c45c4c4694323b97d97aeacef1dd80693e5a018acc43f6a1b42bd7b8d5" :answer/id #uuid "b4da88e1-296a-58ff-9987-641751d7d244" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "k=-\\frac{1}{4}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-127604/selection/b552fda7f0f1aace343d10d4d0d3239e5033799e33a5b6c76d831738f490dc67" :answer/id #uuid "a5bfc3fd-9d89-5285-b49b-b6b59fa8c955" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "k=-1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-127604/selection/d8632041aa9cb2a71b6ada1b8f9b15e5f58f906bc98b3276e25ff9a0f4ed73ae" :answer/id #uuid "7a8aa1bb-7e7e-5c0b-a277-1a361ffce1f6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "k=7" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-127604/selection/2288413a383e153ad9acb6430532cecdb55509b55573ff6fd9f6b1db345a1152" :answer/id #uuid "1d58a81a-a374-5361-a128-b2449498760d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "k=-7" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-127604/selection/644b293827c3a422934cc2950a86aaee10ec84ed2dcf467941e7e17939848267" :answer/id #uuid "77590f99-5831-5a09-8c3a-7ac6096c7384" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "k=-\\frac{3}{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-127604/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "ac21e419-ad99-52f5-aaef-1b357fb0b321" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-127604/selection/b552fda7f0f1aace343d10d4d0d3239e5033799e33a5b6c76d831738f490dc67" :answer-field/choices ["q-127604/selection/b5a1b0c45c4c4694323b97d97aeacef1dd80693e5a018acc43f6a1b42bd7b8d5" "q-127604/selection/b552fda7f0f1aace343d10d4d0d3239e5033799e33a5b6c76d831738f490dc67" "q-127604/selection/d8632041aa9cb2a71b6ada1b8f9b15e5f58f906bc98b3276e25ff9a0f4ed73ae" "q-127604/selection/2288413a383e153ad9acb6430532cecdb55509b55573ff6fd9f6b1db345a1152" "q-127604/selection/644b293827c3a422934cc2950a86aaee10ec84ed2dcf467941e7e17939848267"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-127604" :question/id #uuid "8fd10968-7556-56c2-9450-91e6807cec19" :question/math-academy-id "q-127604" :question/problem "If\n    $U=[\\begin{aligned}3 & -5 \\\\ 2k & -k+2\\end{aligned}]$\nand\n$\\text{det}(U)=-1$, what is the value of $k?$" :question/worked-solution "For a $2\\times 2$ matrix, the determinant is given by the formula\n\n$$\n|\\begin{aligned}a & b \\\\ c & d\\end{aligned}|=ad-bc.\n$$\n\nUsing the formula, we have:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{det}(U) & =|\\begin{aligned}3 & -5 \\\\ 2k & -k+2\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =3\\cdot (-k+2)-(-5)\\cdot 2k \\\\  & =7k+6\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince $det(U)=-1$, we get:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(U) & =-1 \\\\ 7k+6 & =-1 \\\\ 7k & =-1-6 \\\\ 7k & =-7 \\\\ k & =-1\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-127604/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "4ccdde46-a4ab-517e-910b-571a3a166b6a"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-127604"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]}]
